pageDescription: See Dekopon’s gateway, permission broker, Wasm provider host, and build path, then compare its trust boundaries with OpenClaw, Hermes Agent, Amazon Bedrock Agents, and Google Agent Platform.
bodyClass: almanac-page architecture-page
almanacPage: true
architecturePage: true
ogType: article
